# Lane BE-4 — missing LLM provider protocols (Bedrock, Vertex, Copilot chat) + registered remainders

Scope (docs/auditE-core.md §1.8/#6): the three LLM chat protocols behind the
typed `UnsupportedProtocol` clean error (oc-core provider_catalog/facade.rs:48-56),
plus the BE-2b/BE-3b registered remainders that fit: `session.diff` bus
registration, media ROUTE layer only if time allows. oc-core/oc-ai only.

Worktree: `.worktrees/lane-be4` (branch lane/be4).

## Phase inventory (v2 citations)

1. **Bedrock** — ref `packages/ai/src/protocols/bedrock-converse.ts` (892 L) +
   `bedrock-event-stream.ts` (142 L) + `utils/bedrock-auth.ts` (SigV4 via
   aws4fetch; bearer `AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK` wins over SigV4) +
   `utils/bedrock-cache.ts` (4-breakpoint cap, positional `cachePoint` blocks)
   + `utils/bedrock-media.ts` (image/document blocks) + providers
   `amazon-bedrock.ts` (converse, `bedrock-runtime.{region}.amazonaws.com`) and
   `amazon-bedrock-mantle.ts` (`bedrock-mantle.{region}.api.aws/v1`, OpenAI
   chat/responses + Anthropic messages protocols). Rust gap: catalog models
   resolve to `@opencode/ai/providers/amazon-bedrock/mantle[/chat|/responses]`
   (native.rs `mantle()`), all unbound today.
2. **Vertex** — ref `providers/google-vertex.ts` + `google-vertex-shared.ts`:
   Gemini protocol reuse, `https://{location}-aiplatform.googleapis.com
   /v1beta1/projects/{project}/locations/{location}[/publishers/google]`,
   express mode (`aiplatform.googleapis.com/v1/publishers/google` +
   `x-goog-api-key`), tuned `endpoints/` models, ADC bearer
   (`google-auth-library` full chain), `labels` provider option, `serviceTier`
   header `x-vertex-ai-llm-shared-request-type`. Rust: gemini.rs protocol is
   already shared ("Google AI Studio and Vertex"), only the deployment
   (endpoint/auth/project routing) is missing.
3. **Copilot chat** — ref `plugin/provider/github-copilot.ts:434-558`:
   openai-compatible chat over the bound transport, `copilotFetch`/
   `applyHeaders` (Authorization bearer, `Openai-Intent: conversation-edits`,
   `X-GitHub-Api-Version` 2026-08-01, `x-initiator` user/agent escalation,
   `Copilot-Vision-Request`), `interactionType(kind, child)` vocabulary.
   Credential side landed in BE-3b (`integration/copilot.rs`
   CredentialBindings). Chat protocol = openai_compatible route + copilot
   per-request header policy.
4. **session.diff** — v2 `schema/src/v1/session.ts:633-639`: **ephemeral**
   `{sessionID, diff}`; missing from oc-core bus/registry.rs DEFINITIONS.
5. **media ROUTE layer** — optional; register if time runs out.

